"  ┌ Effort ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  "
"  │                                                                          │  "
"  │    None      No extra reasoning. Fastest.            (no thinking)       │  "
"  │    Minimal   Minimal reasoning. Very fast.           (no thinking)       │  "
"  │    Low       Concise responses. Fast.                (~4K tokens)        │  "
"  │ ●  Medium    Balanced quality and speed. Default.    (~16K tokens)       │  "
"  │    High      More thorough responses. Slower.        (~32K tokens)       │  "
"  │    xHigh     Extended reasoning. Slower still.       (~49K tokens)       │  "
"  │    Max       Most thorough responses. Slowest.       (~65K tokens)       │  "
"  │                                                                          │  "
"  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  "
